  "instituteId": "iiitdm-jabalpur",
  "summary": {
    "text": "Student life at IIITDM Jabalpur is organised through the Students Gymkhana, which oversees more than two dozen clubs spread across cultural, science-and-technology and sports wings, alongside a Cultural Council and Sports Council reconstituted every academic year. The cultural wing covers dance, music, dramatics, art and quizzing, while seven technical clubs run astronomy, robotics, CAD, campus racing and hackathon activity. The campus year builds toward three flagship fests — Abhikalpan for technology, Tarang for culture and Gusto for sports — alongside inter-hall contests, national-day celebrations and student exposure visits to Japan.",
